      "writtenOn": "2023-07-21T13:23:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This lgtm - feels like a good step that we can land, and possibly go further.\n\nJim and I chatted briefly yesterday, about the possibility of switching to YUVAInfo (and actually being able to support more/most of the options). We didn\u0027t have much time to dig into that. We\u0027re also waiting to hear back from chromium folks about their needs around separate rescale and readback - it doesn\u0027t seem like something that comes up for them.",
      "revId": "0a17544e891f7a3f299be42d0414e1a8c53728f0",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
