      "writtenOn": "2023-07-21T14:50:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Chrome is also fine with the Pixmap change so that could be added as a separate CL if you want.\n\nNext week I\u0027m going to look into turning Rescale into a separate utility function, that I think could be used for both Ganesh and Graphite at least internally to start. I know Chrome has some cases where they don\u0027t need the rescale so it\u0027s possible we could convince them to make the split, and hence make that external.",
      "revId": "0a17544e891f7a3f299be42d0414e1a8c53728f0",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
