      "writtenOn": "2023-07-22T18:26:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t have any real use case that would benefit particularly from separating them. It just seemed like two different things that got packaged together in one API for a potential optimization that wasn\u0027t implemented and may not actually be faster. Similar, for revisiting YUVAInfo input or YUVAPixmaps output. They seemed like a cleanup opportunity while touching the API but there isn\u0027t a real need on my end.",
      "parentUuid": "bae877b5_2d897b80",
      "revId": "0a17544e891f7a3f299be42d0414e1a8c53728f0",
